      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Domain governor (chiji): one post. The counter 人 is not printed in this column - the cell below the 一 (x2504-2571, y1520-1680) is clean paper, darkest pixel 197 - although Yamazaki's 知事, nine columns further left on the same leaf, prints 一人 in full. No governor's name is given, and the name band below this column is blank (darkest pixel 167), the usual fascicle-9 practice."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
